# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the handles. With branch protection
# on (scripts/setup-branch-protection.sh), a code owner must approve every PR
# that touches their paths.
#
# Last match wins.

*                       @your-org/developers

# Workflow, CI and security rules: changes need a lead.
/.claude/               @your-org/leads
/.github/               @your-org/leads
/hooks/                 @your-org/leads
/iggy.config.json       @your-org/leads
/knowledge/SECURITY_CHECKLIST.md @your-org/security
